Q1: straight vortex in d=2
v = -kappa*y/(2*pi*(y**2 + (V*t - x)**2)) , -kappa*(V*t - x)/(2*pi*(y**2 + (V*t - x)**2))
lap theta_v      = 0
div v            = 0
curl_z v (r!=0)  = 0
d_t theta_v + V.v = 0
circulation      = kappa
v(q) = -i kappa (zhat x q)/q^2 = [I*kappa*q_y/(q_x**2 + q_y**2), -I*kappa*q_x/(q_x**2 + q_y**2)]
q.v(q) = 0
i q x v(q) (z) = kappa (= kappa: point vorticity)
moving: v(q,t) = v(q) exp(-i q.V t)  ->  source frequency omega = q.V
  q=(0.7, 0.4): numeric v(q)=[-0.+3.86658j  0.-6.76651j]  analytic=[0.+3.86658j 0.-6.76651j]  q.v_num=(-0-0j)
  q=(-1.1, 0.9): numeric v(q)=[-0.+2.79944j  0.+3.42154j]  analytic=[0.+2.79944j 0.+3.42154j]  q.v_num=0j
